###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Health
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### Readiness probe (pings Mongo)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/ready

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Auth
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register a new user  → 201
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "full_name": "Prashant Singh",
  "target_role": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "experience_years": 7
}

### Login  → capture access token for the requests below
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### OAuth login (Google id_token or LinkedIn access token)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/oauth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "google",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...google-id-token-placeholder..."
}

### Refresh the access token
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.refresh_token}}"
}

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Resume  (multipart upload — protected)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Upload a resume (PDF / DOCX / TXT) for AI analysis → 201
# Replace the path below with a real file on disk, e.g. ./assets/sample-resume.pdf
POST {{host}}/api/v1/resume/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ResumeBoundary

------ResumeBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./assets/sample-resume.pdf
------ResumeBoundary--

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Interview  (protected)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Start an interview  → 201, returns the first question
# @name startInterview
POST {{host}}/api/v1/interview/start
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "technical",
  "technology": "python",
  "total_questions": 10
}

### Submit an answer to the current question  → evaluation + next question
POST {{host}}/api/v1/interview/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{startInterview.response.body.id}}",
  "text": "A Python decorator is a callable that takes a function and returns a replacement function, typically using @syntax to apply it. Closures capture the enclosing scope...",
  "code": null,
  "language": null,
  "duration_seconds": 47
}

### Submit a coding answer (with code + language)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/interview/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question_id": "{{questionId}}",
  "text": "Reverse a linked list iteratively by flipping each node's next pointer.",
  "code": "def reverse(head):\n    prev = None\n    while head:\n        nxt = head.next\n        head.next = prev\n        prev, head = head, nxt\n    return prev",
  "language": "python",
  "duration_seconds": 312
}

### Complete an interview  → summary + overall score
POST {{host}}/api/v1/interview/{{interviewId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Career  (protected)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Career coach — ask a career question
POST {{host}}/api/v1/career/coach
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do I transition from IC to staff engineer without management experience?",
  "goal_role": "Staff Backend Engineer"
}

### Build a learning roadmap for a target role
POST {{host}}/api/v1/career/roadmap
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "goal_role": "Senior Backend Engineer",
  "gaps": ["system design", "kafka", "kubernetes"]
}

###
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dashboard & analytics  (protected)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard overview
GET {{host}}/api/v1/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Analytics (same shape as dashboard)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Interview history (paginated)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/interviews?skip=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}